<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Julians Messenger</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-YvpcrYf0tY3lHB60NNkmXc5s9fDVZLESaAA55NDzOxhy9GkcIdslK1eN7N6jIeHz"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    
    <style>
        .my-form {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 24px;
            right: 80px;
            left: 80px;
            width: calc(100% - 160px);
        }

        .my-message {
            background-color: #e40c30 !important; /* Rot für eigene Nachrichten */
            color: white;
        }

        .other-message {
            background-color: #f8d7da !important; /* Hellrot für Nachrichten von anderen */
        }

        body {
            background-color: #028fb7; /* Hellblau für den Hintergrund */
        }
        
        .msg-id {
            font-size: 12px;
            position: absolute;
            right: 4px;
            bottom: 4px;    
            color: rgba(5, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .message-container {
            margin-bottom: 20px; /* Abstand zwischen den Nachrichten */
        }

        .navbar-custom {
            background-color: #343a40; /* Dunkle Hintergrundfarbe für die Navigationsleiste */
            color: white; /* Schriftfarbe für die Navigationsleiste */
        }
        
        .navbar-custom .navbar-brand {
            color: white; /* Schriftfarbe für die Navbar-Brand */
            font-size: 1.5em; /* Schriftgröße für die Navbar-Brand */
            font-weight: bold; /* Schriftgewicht für die Navbar-Brand */
        }

        .report-button {
            margin-top: 10px; /* Abstand oberhalb des Report-Buttons */
            margin-left: 10px; /* Abstand links vom Report-Button */
        }
        
        .response {
            background-color: #e0e0e0 !important; /* Grau für ChatGPT-Antworten */
            color: black;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav class="navbar navbar-custom">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Julians Messenger</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        {% for message in messages %}
        <div class="d-flex message-container {% if name == message.user %} justify-content-end {% else %} justify-content-start {% endif %} mt-4">
            <div class="card {% if name == message.user %} my-message {% else %} other-message {% endif %}">
                <div class="card-body position-relative">
                    <b>{{ message.user }}: </b>
                    {{ message.content }}
                    <span class="msg-id">{{ message.id }}</span>
                    <!-- ChatGPT Antwort anzeigen -->
                    {% if message.response %}
                    <div class="response">
                        <b>ChatGPT:</b> {{ message.response }}
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <!-- Report Button -->
                    <form action="/report" method="POST" class="d-inline position-absolute report-button">
                        <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ message.id }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="reported_user" value="{{ message.user }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="reporter" value="{{ name }}">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Report</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <form class="input-group mb-3 my-form" action="" method="POST">
            <input type="text" name="content" class="form-control" placeholder="Bitte geben Sie hier Ihre Nachricht ein">
            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="submit">Senden</button>
        </form>
    </div>

</body>

</html>

Explanation of index.html File
Header and Styling:
Contains meta tags, title, links to Bootstrap, and custom CSS styles.

Body and Navbar:
Defines the navigation bar.

Message Display and Form:

Displays messages, including ChatGPT responses.
Contains the input form for new messages.

